ts buy 1.8 seconds; launcher hits buy 2.6. Gold shields mean 1.25 seconds of protected return. Airborne stones keep flying.'],['The points','Direct hits: castle 3, crew 7, launcher 13. Only the bout winner banks their direct score × bout number. Losing still advances the ten-bout tour. At 90 seconds: castle health %, then direct hits, then draw.'],['Controls',\"'`${app.fireLabel()} hold / release • ${game.input.label('\"'previous')} / \"'${game.input.label('\"'next')} stone • \"'${game.input.label('\"'abort')} cancel • Escape / Options pause. P2 keyboard: Right Shift, U/O, I cancel.\"'`]],actions:[['\"'Replay teaching',()=>{if(app.online){shell.toast('Hosted match','Lessons cannot stop the round.');return;}game.settings.set('skipTeaching',false);app.lessonDone=false;app.lesson=0;app.lessonShot=app.world?.coverage.launch[0]||0;app.lessonBaseline=app.world?.coverage.castle||0;shell.hide();}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});\n app.fireLabel=()=>game.input.lastDevice==='touch'?'Hold anywhere':game.input.label('fire');\n app.about=page=>{const pages=[['Source information',Object.entries(REPORT.sourceInformation).map(([k,v])=>[k.replace(/([A-Z])/g,' \"'$1'\"'),v])],['Testing feedback',REPORT.testingFeedback.map((v,i)=>[['Issues found','Critical issues','Most helpful test','Least helpful test'][i],v])],['Engine feedback',REPORT.engineFeedback.map((v,i)=>[['Best feature','Wrong assumptions','Built for this game','Hardest engine task','Engine changes','Suggested improvement'][i],v])],['Prompt feedback',REPORT.promptFeedback.map((v,i)=>[['What worked','What was confusing','Hardest requirement','Suggested change'][i],v])],['Credits & provenance',[['Original game','Smithereens Under Siege — code-defined tournament, characters, court layouts, music and synth patches created for this build.'],['Engine','my-3D2dge by Michael Crosato. Native assets, material renderer, Humanoid animation, input, UI, synth, particles and terrain. Engine license retained in the delivered source.'],['Online','AI Hub protocol 1 / released client 1.4.0 by Michael Crosato, embedded unchanged.'],['Source reference','Stone Sling / Smithereens\"'! by Robert L. Cheezem. Original manual: odyssey2.info/library/manuals/us_smithereens/smithereens.txt. No original art, music or dialogue copied.'\"']]]];\n const [title,sections]=pages[page];shell.show('about',{kicker:\"'`THE TOURNAMENT RECORD · ${page+1} / ${pages.length}`,title,sections,actions:[['\"'Next page',()=>app.about((page+1)%pages.length)],['Previous page',()=>app.about((page+pages.length-1)%pages.length)],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});};\n app.result=()=>{const w=app.world;if(\"'!w?.outcome||app.resultCount)return;app.resultCount++;app.coverageLog.push({bout:w.bout,court:w.court,...w.coverage});\n const o=w.outcome,win=o.winner,who=win<0?'\"'Honours even':win===0?'The Teal Troupe triumphs':'The Coral Court triumphs';\n if(app.tour){app.tour.results.push({bout:w.bout,winner:win,direct:o.direct,banked:o.banked});app.tour.totals=app.tour.totals.map((n,i)=>n+o.banked[i]);app.tour.next=w.bout+1;if(app.mode==='tour'){if(app.tour.next<10)saveTour(app.storage,app.tour);else eraseTour(app.storage);}}\n const complete=app.tour?.next===10;\n const title=complete?(app.tour.totals[0]===app.tour.totals[1]?'A shared crown\"'!'\"':app.tour.totals[0]>app.tour.totals[1]?'Champion of the rubble\"'!'\"':'A noble second place\"'!'\"'):who;\n const text=complete?'Ten bouts. Five courts. An alarming quantity of dust.':win<0?'A drawn bout banks zero for both sides.':\"'`Bout ${w.bout+1}: ${o.direct[win]} direct points × ${w.bout+1} = ${o.banked[win]} banked. The other side banks zero.`;\n shell.show('\"'results',{kicker:complete?'THE GRAND TOURNAMENT CONCLUDES':\"'`${w.courtDef.short} · ${o.reason.toUpperCase()}${w.cheated?'\"' · DEVELOPER RUN':''}\"'`,title,emblem:complete?'\"'♜':'⚑',text,stats:app.tour?app.tour.totals.map((n,i)=>[n,TEAM[i].name]):o.health.map((n,i)=>[Math.round(n*100)+'%',TEAM[i].name+' CASTLE']),actions:complete?[['Play the tour again',()=>app.startTour(false)],['Quick duel',()=>{app.title();app.setup('quick');}],['Credits',()=>app.about(4)],['Title',()=>app.title()]]:app.tour?[['Next bout',()=>app.prepare(app.mode,{bout:app.tour.next,court:Math.floor(app.tour.next/2),seed:app.tour.seed+app.tour.next})],['Title',()=>app.title()]]:[['Rematch',()=>app.prepare(app.mode,{court:w.court,seed:w.seed+1})],['Change court',()=>{app.title();app.setup('quick');}],['Title',()=>app.title()]],back:()=>app.title()});};\n app.beginAttract=()=>{if(app.online||app.mode\"'!=='\"'title')return;app.frontSaved={stack:shell._stack.slice(),focus:typeof document\"'!=='\"'undefined'?[...shell._els.scr.querySelectorAll('button,input')].indexOf(document.activeElement):0};shell.hide();app.mode='attract';app.attractTicks=0;app.attractSegment=-1;app.attractNext();};\n app.attractNext=()=>{app.attractSegment=(app.attractSegment+1)%3;const court=[0,2,3][app.attractSegment];app.world=createWorld({mode:'attract',court,seed:17+app.attractSegment,duration:28,config:app.config()});view.reset(app.world);app.ais=[createAI({...RIVALS[8],reaction:.45,error:0,harass:.5}),createAI({...RIVALS[8],reaction:.6,error:.01,harass:.5})];app.attractSegmentTick=app.attractTicks;audio.reset();audio.music(court);app.resultAt=0;clearInputs();};\n app.exitAttract=()=>{if(app.mode\"'!=='\"'attract')return;app.cancelAll();app.mode='title';app.idleTicks=0;app.world=createWorld({mode:'title',court:0});view.reset(app.world);audio.reset();audio.music(0);game.particles.list.length=0;const saved=app.frontSaved;app.frontSaved=null;if(saved){shell._stack=saved.stack;const top=shell._stack.at(-1);if(top)top.focus=saved.focus;shell._render();}else app.showTitle();};\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> src/app.js <<'EOF'\n app.developer=(page=0)=>{app.cancelAll();if(app.online){shell.show('developer',{kicker:'HOSTED MATCH · READ ONLY',title:'Match diagnostics',text:()=>\"'`Tick ${app.world.tick} • seed ${app.world.seed} • ${app.online.transport.metrics.sent} packets • ${app.online.transport.metrics.maxBytes} B largest • ACK ${app.online.ack}. World changes are unavailable in scored Hub play.`,actions:[['\"'Refresh',()=>app.developer()],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});return;}\n const w=app.world,pages=4;app.devPage=page;const rows=page===0?['devCourt','devBout','devRival','devSpeed','devInvuln','devCollision','devArc']:TUNING.slice((page-1)*5,page*5).map(a=>'dev_'+a[0]);\n const summary=\"'`Seed ${w.seed} · tick ${w.tick} · ${w.shots.length} flying · castles ${Math.round(health(w,0)*100)} / ${Math.round(health(w,1)*100)}%. Timing affects the next action; gravity affects new stones; health preserves each block'\"'s health fraction. Developer changes mark this run.\"'`;\n shell.show('\"'developer',{kicker:\"'`THE MARSHAL'\"'S TOOLBOX · \"'${page+1} / ${pages}`,title:page===0?'\"'Scenarios & diagnostics':'Live balance sliders',text:summary,rows,actions:[...(page===0?[\n ['Restart this bout',()=>{const {mode,bout,court,seed}=w;app.prepare(mode,{bout,court,seed});app.world.cheated=true;}],\n ['Load chosen scenario',()=>{app.prepare(app.mode==='tour'?'tour':'quick',{bout:game.settings.devBout-1,court:COURTS.findIndex(c=>c.short===game.settings.devCourt),seed:w.seed});app.ais[1]=createAI(RIVALS[Number(game.settings.devRival.split('.')[0])-1]);app.world.cheated=true;}],\n ['More test tools',()=>app.tools()],['Court authoring',()=>app.editor()]]:[]),\n ['Next page',()=>app.developer((page+1)%pages)],['Reset balance defaults',()=>{for(const [k]of TUNING)game.settings.set('dev_'+k,DEFAULTS[k]);applyTuning(w,DEFAULTS);app.developer(page);}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});};\n app.tools=()=>shell.show('tools',{kicker:'LOCAL TOOLS · RESULTS ARE MARKED',title:'The useful mischief',text:()=>\"'`Tick ${app.world.tick} · ${app.stepOnly?'\"'manual stepping':'normal simulation'} · AI seats \"'${app.ais.map(a=>a?'\"'AI':'human').join(' / ')}\"'`,actions:[\n ['\"'Restore both castles',()=>{app.world.castles=createWorld({court:app.world.court,customCourt:app.customCourt,config:app.world.config}).castles;app.world.revision++;app.world.cheated=true;shell.toast('Castles restored');}],\n ['Clear airborne stones',()=>{app.world.shots=[];app.world.cheated=true;}],['Skip teaching',()=>{app.lessonDone=true;shell.tutorial(null);}],\n ['Toggle teal AI / human',()=>{app.ais[0]=app.ais[0]?null:createAI({...RIVALS[8],error:0});app.world.cheated=true;app.tools();}],\n ['Toggle coral AI / human',()=>{app.ais[1]=app.ais[1]?null:createAI(RIVALS[8]);app.world.cheated=true;app.tools();}],\n ['Pause / resume simulation',()=>{app.stepOnly=\"'!app.stepOnly;app.tools();}],\n ['\"'Step one fixed tick',()=>{step(app.world);drain();view.update(DT);app.tools();}],\n ['Force teal ceremony',()=>{app.world.cheated=true;finish(app.world,'developer inspection',0);drain();shell.hide();app.resultAt=game.real-2;}],\n ['Force coral ceremony',()=>{app.world.cheated=true;finish(app.world,'developer inspection',1);drain();shell.hide();app.resultAt=game.real-2;}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});\n app.editorBlock=()=>{const b=(app.customCourt||app.world.courtDef).blocks;app.editorIndex=clamp(app.editorIndex,0,b.length-1);return b[app.editorIndex];};\n app.editor=(page=0)=>{if(app.online)return;if(\"'!app.customCourt)app.customCourt=JSON.parse(exportCourt(app.world.courtDef)).court;const c=app.customCourt,b=app.editorBlock();view.selection=b;\n for(const [k,v]of [['\"'editorX',b.x],['editorZ',b.z],['editorMaterial',MATERIAL[b.material].name],['editorFoundation',b.foundation]])game.settings.set(k,v);\n const change=delta=>{app.applyEditor();app.editorIndex=(app.editorIndex+delta+c.blocks.length)%c.blocks.length;app.editor(page);};\n const support=c.blocks[(app.editorSupport||0)%c.blocks.length];\n shell.show('editor',{kicker:\"'`COURT WORKSHOP · BLOCK ${b.id} · ${page+1} / 2`,title:page?'\"'Supports & sharing':'Carve your own calamity',text:\"'`${c.name}. Select with the buttons, edit with arrows or pointer, then Apply. Symmetry is automatic. ${b.foundation?'\"'Foundation — not an objective.':'Objective — '+b.support.length+' support links.'}\"'`,rows:page?[]:['\"'editorX','editorZ','editorMaterial','editorFoundation'],actions:page?[\n [\"'`Support target: block ${support.id}`,()=>{app.editorSupport=((app.editorSupport||0)+1)%c.blocks.length;app.editor(1);}],\n [b.support.includes(support.id)?'\"'Unlink selected support':'Link selected support',()=>{if(b.id\"'!==support.id)b.support=b.support.includes(support.id)?b.support.filter(id=>id!==support.id):[...b.support,support.id];app.editor(1);}],\n ['\"'Validate geometry & reachability',()=>app.validateEditor()],['Preview support collapse',()=>{app.applyEditor();const found=app.world.castles[1].find(a=>a.id===b.id);if(found&&\"'!found.foundation){found.hp=0;app.world.revision++;importCollapse();}shell.hide();app.world.cheated=true;}],\n ['\"'Export definition',()=>{app.editorText=exportCourt(c);app.shareEditor();}],['Import definition',()=>app.shareEditor()],['Geometry page',()=>app.editor(0)],['Back',()=>{view.selection=null;shell.back();}]\n ]:[['Previous block',()=>change(-1)],['Next block',()=>change(1)],['Apply geometry',()=>{app.applyEditor();app.editor(0);}],['Add block',()=>{app.applyEditor();const id=Math.max(...c.blocks.map(a=>a.id))+1;c.blocks.push({id,x:clamp(b.x+20,22,180),z:b.z,w:19,h:18,material:'S',foundation:false,support:[b.id]});app.editorIndex=c.blocks.length-1;app.editor();}],['Remove block',()=>{if(c.blocks.length>2){c.blocks.splice(app.editorIndex,1);for(const a of c.blocks)a.support=a.support.filter(id=>id\"'!==b.id);app.editorIndex=0;app.editor();}}],['\"'Supports & sharing',()=>{app.applyEditor();app.editor(1);}],['Reset authored court',()=>{app.customCourt=null;view.selection=null;app.editorIndex=8;app.editor();}],['Back',()=>{view.selection=null;shell.back();}]]});};\n app.applyEditor=()=>{const b=app.editorBlock();b.x=game.settings.editorX;b.z=game.settings.editorZ;b.material=Object.keys(MATERIAL).find(k=>MATERIAL[k].name===game.settings.editorMaterial);b.foundation=game.settings.editorFoundation;\n const valid=validateCourt({version:1,court:app.customCourt});if(valid.ok){const fresh=createWorld({court:app.world.court,customCourt:app.customCourt,config:app.world.config});app.world.castles=fresh.castles;app.world.courtDef=app.customCourt;app.world.revision++;app.world.cheated=true;}return valid;};\n function importCollapse(){const b=app.world.castles[1],seen=connected(b);for(const a of b)if(\"'!a.foundation&&a.hp>0&&!seen.has(a.id)){a.hp=0;view.event({type:'\"'fall',seat:1,id:a.id,x:a.x,z:a.z,w:a.w,h:a.h,material:a.material,tick:app.world.tick});}}\n app.validateEditor=()=>{const valid=app.applyEditor();let msg=valid.errors.join(' ');if(valid.ok){const w=createWorld({customCourt:app.customCourt});let seen=new Set();for(let p=.1;p<1;p+=.003)for(const h of predict(w,0,0,p).hits)if(h.kind==='castle')seen.add(h.id);msg=\"'`Support graph connected. ${seen.size} visible blocks directly targetable; hidden blocks open as walls fall. Last-fragment reachability checked in verification.`;}shell.toast(valid.ok?'\"'Court is valid':'Court needs attention',msg,10);};\n app.shareEditor=()=>{shell.show('court-data',{kicker:'VERSION 1 COURT DATA',title:'Import / export',text:'The text stays local. Export copies into this field; paste a definition and choose Import. No files or network required.',actions:[['Import this definition',()=>{try{const raw=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('court-json').value),v=validateCourt(raw);if(\"'!v.ok)throw Error(v.errors.join('\"' '));app.customCourt=v.court;app.editorIndex=0;app.editorText='';app.applyEditor();shell.back();app.editor();}catch(e){shell.toast('Import rejected',String(e.message),8);}}],['Copy to clipboard',()=>{const el=document.getElementById('court-json');el.select();globalThis.navigator?.clipboard?.writeText(el.value)?.catch(()=>{});}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});\n if(typeof document\"'!=='\"'undefined'){const text=document.createElement('textarea');text.id='court-json';text.value=app.editorText||exportCourt(app.customCourt);text.setAttribute('aria-label','Court JSON definition');text.rows=7;const box=shell._els.scr.querySelector('.esh-mod');box.insertBefore(text,box.querySelector('.esh-btns'));text.addEventListener('keydown',e=>e.stopPropagation());}};\n function drain(){for(const e of app.world.events.splice(0)){view.event(e);audio.event(e);}}\n function hands(){if(app.ended||app.online?.info?.server)return;\n const count=app.mode==='local'?2:1;for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const seat=app.online?app.online.seat:i;if(seat===null)continue;const I=game.players[i]||game.input;\n if(I.padLost){app.cancelAll();if(app.online){shell.toast('Controller disconnected','The shared clock continues. Reconnect or use the keyboard.');}else game.pause('controller');continue;}\n if(app.ais[i]&&\"'!app.online)continue;\n const held=I.down('\"'fire');if(app.blocked[i]){if(\"'!held)app.blocked[i]=false;else continue;}\n if(I.pressed('\"'abort')){app.intent(seat,{kind:'cancel'});app.blocked[i]=true;app.wasFire[i]=false;continue;}\n if(held&&\"'!app.wasFire[i]){app.intent(seat,{kind:'\"'begin'});app.holdStart[i]=game.real;}\n if(\"'!held&&app.wasFire[i])app.intent(seat,{kind:'\"'release'});\n app.wasFire[i]=held;\n if(I.pressed('previous'))app.choose(seat,-1);if(I.pressed('next'))app.choose(seat,1);\n if(I.down('left')||I.down('right'))view.guidance[seat]=clamp(view.guidance[seat]+(I.down('right')?1:-1)*2,25,935);\n }\n }\n function teaching(){if(app.lessonDone||app.mode\"'!=='\"'tour')return;const w=app.world,shot=w.coverage.launch.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),hit=w.players[0].score;\n if(app.lesson===0&&shot>app.lessonShot)app.lesson=1;if(app.lesson===1&&hit>0)app.lesson=2;\n const p=game.input.label('fire'),prev=game.input.label('previous'),next=game.input.label('next');\n let title,text;if(app.lesson===0){title='Wind up, your lordship.';text=\"'`Hold ${p}. The diamond shows the first contact. Release to fling.`;}else if(app.lesson===1){title='\"'A little more. A little less.';text='Aim for the far castle. Full tension overshoots; try about two-thirds.';}else{title=w.bout>=4?'Split the difference.':w.bout>=2?'Mind the supports.':'A most respectable hit\"'!'\"';text=w.bout>=4?\"'`${prev} / ${next}: split stone fans into three at the apex. Roundstone finishes small pieces.`:w.bout>=2?`${prev} / ${next}: masonry stone breaks reinforced blocks and their supports.`:'\"'Castle hits are permanent. Crew and launcher hits buy a brief opening.';if(shot>app.lessonShot+3){app.lessonDone=true;}}\n app.lessonText={title,text};\n }\n function combatUpdate(dt){if(app.online){app.online.update();if(app.ended)return;if(\"'!app.online.info?.server){if(!shell.screen&&!game.paused)hands();view.update(dt,{seat:app.online.seat??0,assist:game.settings.prediction,reduced:game.reduceMotion});updateHUD();}return;}\n if(!shell.screen&&!game.paused)hands();\n if(!app.stepOnly){app.simCarry=(app.simCarry||0)+app.simSpeed;while(app.simCarry>=1){for(let s=0;s<2;s++)if(app.ais[s]){\n  // The opening opponent waits for a real first shot, giving the first lesson room to breathe.\n  if(app.mode==='\"'tour'&&app.world.bout===0&&app.lesson===0&&\"'!app.lessonDone)continue;\n  aiStep(app.world,s,app.ais[s]);}\n step(app.world);app.simCarry--;}}\n drain();teaching();view.update(dt,{seat:0,assist:game.settings.prediction,reduced:game.reduceMotion});updateHUD();\n if(app.world.outcome&&!app.resultCount){if(!app.resultAt)app.resultAt=game.real;if(game.real-app.resultAt>=1.8)app.result();}\n }\n const scenes={title:{view:'\"'siege',camera:{zoom:false},update(dt){view.update(dt,{title:true,reduced:game.reduceMotion});if(app.mode==='attract'){app.attractTicks++;\n const elapsed=(app.attractTicks-app.attractSegmentTick)*DT;for(let s=0;s<2;s++){app.ais[s].goal=elapsed<7?'launcher':elapsed<13?'crew':null;aiStep(app.world,s,app.ais[s]);}\n step(app.world);drain();if(app.world.outcome&&elapsed>27||elapsed>=30)app.attractNext();updateHUD();}else{app.idleTicks++;if(app.idleTicks>=1200)app.beginAttract();}},draw:r=>view.draw(r)},combat:{view:'siege',camera:{zoom:false},pausable:true,update:combatUpdate,draw:r=>{if(\"'!app.online?.info?.server)view.draw(r);},back(){app.cancelAll();return false;}}};\n game.hook('\"'input',()=>{const I=game.input;if(app.ended){I.consumeAll();for(const p of game.players)p.clear();return;}\n if(I.anyPressed()){app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){app.exitAttract();I.consumeAll();I.clear();return;}}\n if(I.pressed('pause')||game.paused&&\"'!app.lastPaused){app.cancelAll();}app.lastPaused=game.paused;\n if(app.online&&game.paused&&app.online.intentStart!==null)app.online.intent('\"'cancel');\n });\n // Native shell keeps device focus; pointer hover follows the same focus ring.\n if(typeof document\"'!=='\"'undefined'){\n document.addEventListener('pointerover',e=>{if(e.target.matches('.esh button:not(:disabled)'))e.target.focus({preventScroll:true});});\n document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(app.ended){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();return;}app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();app.exitAttract();}},true);\n document.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(app.ended){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();return;}app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();app.exitAttract();}},true);\n document.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(Math.abs(e.movementX)+Math.abs(e.movementY)>1)app.idleTicks=0;});\n document.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){e.preventDefault();app.exitAttract();}},{capture:true,passive:false});\n addEventListener('blur',()=>app.cancelAll());document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden)app.cancelAll();});\n const canvas=document.getElementById('screen');\n game.input.touchEnabled=false;game.input.touchFilter=()=>false;\n canvas.addEventListener('contextmenu',e=>e.preventDefault());\n canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.pointerType==='mouse'||app.mode==='title'||app.mode==='attract'||shell.screen||app.ended)return;\n if(app.pointers.size)return;e.preventDefault();canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);const seat=app.online?app.online.seat:app.mode==='local'&&e.clientX>innerWidth/2?1:0;if(seat===null)return;\n app.pointers.set(e.pointerId,seat);game.input.lastDevice='touch';app.intent(seat,{kind:'begin'});app.touchPoint={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY};});\n canvas.addEventListener('pointerup',e=>{if(\"'!app.pointers.has(e.pointerId))return;e.preventDefault();const seat=app.pointers.get(e.pointerId);app.pointers.delete(e.pointerId);app.intent(seat,{kind:'\"'release'});app.touchPoint=null;});\n canvas.addEventListener('pointercancel',e=>{if(app.pointers.has(e.pointerId)){app.intent(app.pointers.get(e.pointerId),{kind:'cancel'});app.pointers.delete(e.pointerId);app.touchPoint=null;}});\n canvas.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{if(app.mode\"'!=='\"'title'&&\"'!shell.screen){e.preventDefault();app.choose(app.online?.seat??0,e.deltaY>0?1:-1);}},{passive:false});\n canvas.addEventListener('\"'pointermove',e=>{if(e.pointerType==='mouse'&&app.world){const p=game.input.screenPoint(e.clientX,e.clientY);if(p){const worldx=p[0]+game.screen.ix;view.guidance[app.online?.seat??0]=worldx;app.hover=app.world.castles.flat().find(b=>b.hp>0&&worldx>=b.x&&worldx<=b.x+b.w&&-(p[1]+game.screen.iy)>=b.z&&-(p[1]+game.screen.iy)<=b.z+b.h)||null;}}});\n createHUD();\n }\n function createHUD(){const root=document.createElement('div');root.id='combat-hud';root.innerHTML='<div class=\\\"court-clock\\\"><span id=\\\"court-name\\\"></span><strong id=\\\"clock\\\"></strong><small id=\\\"bout-label\\\"></small></div>'+[0,1].map(s=>\"'`<section class=\"team-plate team-${s}\"><div class=\"plate-name\"><span id=\"seat-${s}\"></span><b id=\"score-${s}\"></b></div><div class=\"health-rail\"><i id=\"health-${s}\"></i></div><div class=\"power-rail\"><i id=\"power-${s}\"></i></div><div class=\"plate-foot\"><span id=\"stone-${s}\"></span><strong id=\"status-${s}\"></strong></div></section>`).join('\"'')+'<div id=\\\"lesson-card\\\"><b></b><span></span><button id=\\\"skip-lesson\\\">Skip lesson</button></div><div id=\\\"combat-caption\\\"></div><div id=\\\"stone-tray\\\"></div><div id=\\\"combat-hint\\\"></div><div id=\\\"attract-label\\\"><b>THE ROYAL EXHIBITION</b><span>Demonstration · any input returns to the menu</span></div><div id=\\\"touch-halo\\\"></div><canvas id=\\\"target-inset\\\" width=\\\"250\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" aria-label=\\\"Magnified opposing castle\\\"></canvas>';\n document.body.appendChild(root);document.getElementById('skip-lesson').onclick=()=>{app.lessonDone=true;};for(let i=0;i<3;i++){const b=document.createElement('button');b.dataset.stone=i;b.innerHTML=\"'`<span class=\"stone-icon icon-${i}\"></span><span>${STONES[i].short}</span>`;b.onclick=()=>{if(!shell.screen)app.intent(app.online?.seat??0,{kind:'\"'stone',stone:i});};document.getElementById('stone-tray').appendChild(b);}app.hud=root;}\n function setText(id,text){const el=document.getElementById(id);if(el&&el.textContent\"'!==text)el.textContent=text;}\n function updateHUD(){if(!app.hud)return;const w=app.world,show=['\"'tour','quick','local','hub','attract'].includes(app.mode)&&\"'!shell.screen&&!app.ended;app.hud.hidden=!show;document.body.dataset.mode=app.mode;\n if(!show)return;const online=app.online,info=online?.info;\n setText('\"'court-name',w.courtDef.short);setText('clock',online&&\"'!online.started?'\"'READY':online&&online.hub.time()<0?Math.ceil(-online.hub.time()/1000).toString():\"'`${Math.floor(Math.max(0,w.deadline-w.tick)*DT/60)}:${String(Math.ceil(Math.max(0,w.deadline-w.tick)*DT)%60).padStart(2,'\"'0')}\"'`);\n setText('\"'bout-label',app.tour?\"'`BOUT ${w.bout+1} OF 10 · ×${w.bout+1} POINTS`:online?'\"'HUB DUEL':'EXHIBITION DUEL');\n for(let s=0;s<2;s++){const p=w.players[s],pow=online&&s===online.seat&&online.intentStart\"'!==null?clamp((online.hub.time()/1000-online.intentStart)/w.config.chargeTime,0,1):powerOf(w,p),end=Math.max(p.crewUntil,p.launcherUntil);\n setText(`seat-${s}`,info?.players[s]?.name||(s===1&&app.ais[1]?(app.mode==='\"'tour'?RIVALS[w.bout].name:app.ais[1].profile.name):TEAM[s].name));setText(\"'`score-${s}`,`${p.score} PTS`);document.getElementById(`health-${s}`).style.width=health(w,s)*100+'\"'%';document.getElementById(\"'`power-${s}`).style.width=pow*100+'\"'%';\n setText(\"'`stone-${s}`,STONES[p.stone].short);setText(`status-${s}`,w.outcome?'\"'BELL\"'!'\"':w.tick<p.launcherUntil?\"'`⚒ REPAIR ${((p.launcherUntil-w.tick)*DT).toFixed(1)}`:w.tick<p.crewUntil?`CREW AWAY ${((p.crewUntil-w.tick)*DT).toFixed(1)}`:w.tick<p.protectUntil&&w.tick>=end?'\"'◇ PROTECTED':p.charge>=0?\"'`${Math.round(pow*100)}% TENSION`:w.tick<p.ready?'\"'RELOADING':'READY');}\n const seat=online?.seat??0;for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-stone]')){b.classList.toggle('selected',Number(b.dataset.stone)===w.players[seat].stone);b.disabled=\"'!w.allowed.includes(Number(b.dataset.stone));}\n document.getElementById('\"'attract-label').hidden=app.mode\"'!=='\"'attract';document.getElementById('stone-tray').hidden=app.mode==='attract';\n const lesson=document.getElementById('lesson-card');lesson.hidden=app.lessonDone||app.mode\"'!=='\"'tour';if(\"'!lesson.hidden&&app.lessonText){lesson.querySelector('\"'b').textContent=app.lessonText.title;lesson.querySelector('span').textContent=app.lessonText.text;}\n const device=game.input.lastDevice,touch=device==='touch';app.hud.classList.toggle('touch',touch);setText('combat-hint',touch?'Hold to wind · release to sling':\"'`${app.fireLabel()}  HOLD / RELEASE     ${game.input.label('\"'previous')} / \"'${game.input.label('\"'next')}  STONE     \"'${game.input.label('\"'abort')}  CANCEL\"'`);\n setText('\"'combat-caption',game.real<app.captionUntil?app.caption:app.hover?\"'`${MATERIAL[app.hover.material].name} · ${Math.ceil(app.hover.hp)} health`:'\"'');\n const halo=document.getElementById('touch-halo');halo.hidden=\"'!app.touchPoint;if(app.touchPoint){halo.style.left=app.touchPoint.x+'\"'px';halo.style.top=app.touchPoint.y+'px';halo.textContent=Math.round(powerOf(w,w.players[seat])*100)+'%';}\n const cv=document.getElementById('target-inset');cv.hidden=innerHeight<innerWidth||shell.screen\"'!==null; // native pixel target enlarged, while the complete lane stays visible below.\n if(!cv.hidden&&game.screen.buf){const ctx=cv.getContext('\"'2d');ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;const a=game.r.w(seat?30:750,0,178),b=game.r.w(seat?215:935,0,25);ctx.clearRect(0,0,250,160);try{ctx.drawImage(game.screen.buf,a[0],a[1],b[0]-a[0],b[1]-a[1],0,0,250,160);}catch{}}\n }\n app.snapshot=()=>({mode:app.mode,phase:app.world?.phase,tick:app.world?.tick,court:app.world?.court,bout:app.world?.bout,health:app.world?[health(app.world,0),health(app.world,1)]:null,shots:app.world?.shots.length,coverage:app.world?.coverage,outcome:app.world?.outcome,tour:app.tour,menu:shell.screen,lesson:app.lesson,errors:game.errors});\n game.debug={snapshot:app.snapshot};game.fadeTime=0;\n app.startOnline=async()=>{app.online=new OnlineMatch(globalThis.AIHub,{onWorld:w=>{app.world=w;app.mode='hub';app.ais=[null,null];view.reset(w);shell.hide();game.go('combat',null,{fade:0});},onEnd:e=>{app.ended=true;app.cancelAll();audio.stop();game.input.clear();app.hud&&(app.hud.hidden=true);shell.hide();app.caption=e.reason;},onEvent:e=>{view.event(e);if(\"'!app.online.info?.server)audio.event(e);}});\n const info=await app.online.connect();if(!info){app.online=null;game.live=false;app.title();}else{game.o.menu.quit=false;game.live=true;if(!info.server)audio.music(4);}};\n game.start({scene:'\"'title',scenes});\n if(globalThis.AIHub?.active)app.startOnline().catch(e=>game.fail('Hub connection',e));else app.title();\n if(typeof window\"'!=='\"'undefined'){window.__SIEGE={app,game,get world(){return app.world;},command,predict,planShot,createAI,aiStep,step,REPORT};window.__game={game};document.title=TITLE;}\n return app;\n}\nfunction safeStorage(){try{return globalThis.localStorage||{getItem(){return null;},setItem(){},removeItem(){}};}catch{return {getItem(){return null;},setItem(){},removeItem(){}};}}\nEOF\ncat > src/entry.js <<'EOF'\nimport { boot } from './app.js';\nboot(globalThis.My3D2dge);\nEOF\ncat > src/style.css <<'EOF'\n:root{--ui-scale:1; color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#182d3b;color:#f2e7d0}body{font-family:'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif}#screen{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;touch-action:none}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f5d390;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.4}.esh{--accent:#efd194\"'!important;--paper:#172b39!important;--line:#677e80!important}.esh-sh{background:#101f2cdb!important;padding:30px!important}.esh-sh h2{font:normal 31px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffe7b0}.esh-mod{border:1px solid #84908b!important;border-radius:2px!important;box-shadow:0 8px 0 #0a1823,0 22px 70px #050d15aa!important;max-width:650px!important;max-height:94%!important;padding:26px 30px!important;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#273e49,#172b39)!important}.esh-pan{border-radius:2px!important}.esh-k{color:#dbbe85!important;letter-spacing:.19em!important;font-size:10px!important}.esh-m{color:#c3ccc4!important;line-height:1.55!important}.esh-sh button{border:1px solid #6b8285!important;border-radius:2px!important;background:#1b3341!important;min-height:40px!important;padding:10px 16px!important;text-align:left!important;letter-spacing:.025em;transition:background .14s,border-color .14s}.esh-sh button:hover,.esh-sh button:focus{background:#344b52!important;border-color:#efcf8e!important;outline:none!important;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #efcf8e!important}.esh-sh button.pri{color:#182b38!important;background:#edce91!important;border-color:#f8e3b9!important;font-weight:bold!important}.esh-sh button.pri:focus,.esh-sh button.pri:hover{background:#ffe6b3!important;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #6f6147!important}.esh-ttl{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#152b39fb,#142c3aeb 33%,#142c3a38 68%,#152d3a00)!important;padding:0!important;place-items:center start!important}.esh-ttl>div{margin-left:5.8vw;padding:0!important;max-width:520px!important;position:relative}.esh-ttl>div:before{content:'\"'♜';display:block;color:#d7bd82;font:36px Georgia;line-height:1;margin-bottom:18px}.esh-ttl h1{white-space:pre-line\"'!important;font:700 clamp(40px,4.4vw,67px)/.93 Georgia,serif!important;letter-spacing:-.055em!important;color:#f6e4bd!important;text-shadow:0 3px 0 #5c5d54,0 9px 20px #102431;margin:12px 0 0!important}.esh-sub{font:italic 21px Georgia!important;color:#e9c27e!important;margin:16px 0 18px!important}.esh-ttl p{font-size:14px!important;color:#bdcfcb!important}.esh-ttl .esh-btns{max-width:245px;gap:6px!important}.esh-ttl .esh-btns button{font-size:14px!important;min-height:37px!important;padding:8px 14px!important}.esh-ttl .esh-tags{font-size:9px!important;gap:14px!important;color:#bdd2cf!important}.esh-ttl .esh-m{font-size:9px!important;max-width:290px;margin-top:10px!important}.esh-sec{margin-top:16px!important}.esh-row{border-color:#516974!important}input[type=range]{accent-color:#e8c688}#court-json{width:100%;min-height:130px;border:1px solid #7c9294;background:#0f2230;color:#e9dfc1;font:10px/1.4 monospace;resize:vertical;padding:10px}.esh-btns{gap:6px!important}.esh-stats{color:#edce91!important}.esh-emb{font-size:35px!important;color:#efce8c!important}.esh-back{color:#f2dbac!important}\n#combat-hud{pointer-events:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:12;color:#f4e6c5;font-size:clamp(12px,1.4vw,27px);padding:3.2vh 3.2vw;letter-spacing:.025em}#combat-hud[hidden],[hidden]{display:none!important}.team-plate{position:absolute;top:4vh;width:28vw;max-width:550px;padding:14px 18px 12px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#17313feb,#233b44db);border-top:3px solid #7adcd1;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #1527337a}.team-0{left:3.2vw}.team-1{right:3.2vw;border-color:#eea17d;background:linear-gradient(250deg,#28323feb,#403b45db)}.plate-name{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-weight:bold;font-size:.84em}.plate-name span{color:#a1e4db;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.team-1 .plate-name span{color:#f3b99a}.plate-name b{font-size:.8em;white-space:nowrap;color:#edce91}.health-rail{height:5px;background:#122533;margin:11px 0 7px;position:relative}.health-rail i{display:block;height:100%;background:#7ac8b5;transition:width .15s}.team-1 .health-rail i{background:#da947d}.power-rail{height:9px;background:#102632;border:1px solid #647a7b}.power-rail i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8dccb4,#f2d18b,#ed9878)}.plate-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:7px;font-size:.56em;letter-spacing:.08em}.plate-foot strong{color:#ecd397;font-weight:normal}.court-clock{position:absolute;left:50%;top:4vh;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-shadow:0 2px 3px #203441;gap:4px;white-space:nowrap}.court-clock span{font-size:.51em;letter-spacing:.25em;color:#f9e6c0}.court-clock strong{font:normal clamp(28px,3.3vw,63px)/1 Georgia,serif;color:#fff0c9}.court-clock small{font-size:.38em;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#d1dcd5}#stone-tray{position:absolute;bottom:6.8vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:8px;pointer-events:auto}#stone-tray button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:1px solid #8b9b94;background:#213944e8;color:#bdcdc7;font:inherit;font-size:.6em;letter-spacing:.13em;padding:12px 19px;min-height:48px;box-shadow:0 4px #132733;white-space:nowrap}#stone-tray button.selected{border-color:#f5d596;color:#f5d596;background:#3e4d4de8;box-shadow:inset 0 -3px #e1c083,0 4px #142631}.stone-icon{width:15px;height:15px;background:#d3e4e8;border:2px solid #7f9399;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:inset 3px 3px #f6ead1}.icon-1{width:19px;height:19px;border-radius:2px;background:#ddb176;transform:rotate(-15deg)}.icon-2{background:#b8a0e2;border-color:#7b659f;clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 25%,90% 83%,50% 100%,0 68%,10% 15%)}#combat-hint{position:absolute;bottom:2.8vh;left:0;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:.49em;letter-spacing:.09em;text-shadow:1px 2px 3px #112739;color:#d5ded5}#combat-caption{position:absolute;left:50%;top:27vh;transform:translateX(-50%);font:italic .75em Georgia,serif;text-align:center;max-width:50vw;color:#fce4b4;text-shadow:0 2px 4px #263c48}#lesson-card{position:absolute;left:3.2vw;bottom:18vh;max-width:28vw;background:#203744f0;border-left:3px solid #edcb8b;padding:14px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;box-shadow:0 6px #13263366}#lesson-card b{font:normal 1em Georgia;color:#f4d59b}#lesson-card span{font-size:.64em;line-height:1.4;color:#d8dfd5}#lesson-card button{pointer-events:auto;align-self:flex-start;border:0;background:none;color:#c9b98e;font-size:.52em;padding:2px 0;text-decoration:underline}#attract-label{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:5vh;transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center;background:#1b3343e8;border:1px solid #c5b27d;padding:17px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:430px}#attract-label b{font:1.1em Georgia;color:#f4daa5;letter-spacing:.07em}#attract-label span{font-size:.6em;color:#cbd6cc}#touch-halo{position:fixed;border:2px solid #f5d697;border-radius:50%;width:82px;height:82px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;background:#23394560;font:bold 22px Georgia;color:#fff0be;box-shadow:0 0 0 10px #ebd19520}#target-inset{position:absolute;top:20vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:64vw;height:41vw;border:2px solid #adab92;background:#7b94a1;image-rendering:pixelated;box-shadow:0 6px 20px #10253388}\n@media(max-width:800px){.esh-ttl>div{margin-left:6vw!important;max-width:89%!important}.esh-ttl h1{font-size:40px!important}.esh-ttl .esh-k{font-size:9px!important}.esh-mod{padding:19px!important}.esh-sh{padding:14px!important}.esh-ttl .esh-btns{max-width:270px}.esh-ttl .esh-btns button{font-size:14px!important}.team-plate{padding:8px 9px;width:35vw;top:3vh}.team-0{left:3vw}.team-1{right:3vw}.plate-name{font-size:10px;gap:5px}.plate-name b{font-size:8px}.plate-foot{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:0;gap:4px;min-height:10px}.court-clock{top:3vh}.court-clock span{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.12em;max-width:23vw;overflow:hidden}.court-clock strong{font-size:27px}.court-clock small{font-size:6px}.health-rail{margin:7px 0 5px;height:4px}.power-rail{height:7px}#stone-tray button{font-size:9px;padding:10px;gap:7px;min-height:39px}#stone-tray{bottom:10vh}#combat-hint{font-size:8px;bottom:6vh}#combat-caption{top:31vh;max-width:75vw;width:75vw;font-size:12px}#lesson-card{max-width:80vw;left:10vw;bottom:23vh;padding:10px 12px}#lesson-card b{font-size:16px}#lesson-card span{font-size:12px}#lesson-card button{font-size:10px}#attract-label{min-width:80vw;padding:13px}#attract-label b{font-size:16px}#attract-label span{font-size:11px}.touch #combat-hint{display:none}.touch #stone-tray{bottom:8vh}.touch #stone-tray button{font-size:10px}.esh-tags{flex-wrap:wrap}}\n@media(orientation:portrait){.esh-ttl{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#162e3bf7,#182f3ce0 56%,#182f3c30)!important}.esh-ttl>div{margin-top:-8vh}.esh-ttl h1{font-size:42px!important}.esh-ttl>div:before{font-size:25px;margin-bottom:9px}.esh-ttl .esh-btns{max-width:270px}.esh-sub{font-size:17px!important}.esh-ttl p{font-size:12px!important}#combat-caption{top:auto;bottom:31vh;font-size:12px}#stone-tray{bottom:13vh}#lesson-card{bottom:21vh}#lesson-card span{font-size:11px}.team-plate{width:36vw}.plate-name{font-size:9px}.plate-name b{font-size:7px}.plate-foot{font-size:7px}.court-clock{top:4vh}.court-clock small{max-width:20vw;text-align:center;white-space:normal;line-height:1.5}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> src/app.js <<'EOF'\n app.developer=(page=0)=>{app.cancelAll();if(app.online){shell.show('developer',{kicker:'HOSTED MATCH · READ ONLY',title:'Match diagnostics',text:()=>\"'`Tick ${app.world.tick} • seed ${app.world.seed} • ${app.online.transport.metrics.sent} packets • ${app.online.transport.metrics.maxBytes} B largest • ACK ${app.online.ack}. World changes are unavailable in scored Hub play.`,actions:[['\"'Refresh',()=>app.developer()],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});return;}\n const w=app.world,pages=4;app.devPage=page;const rows=page===0?['devCourt','devBout','devRival','devSpeed','devInvuln','devCollision','devArc']:TUNING.slice((page-1)*5,page*5).map(a=>'dev_'+a[0]);\n const summary=\"'`Seed ${w.seed} · tick ${w.tick} · ${w.shots.length} flying · castles ${Math.round(health(w,0)*100)} / ${Math.round(health(w,1)*100)}%. Timing affects the next action; gravity affects new stones; health preserves each block'\"'s health fraction. Developer changes mark this run.\"'`;\n shell.show('\"'developer',{kicker:\"'`THE MARSHAL'\"'S TOOLBOX · \"'${page+1} / ${pages}`,title:page===0?'\"'Scenarios & diagnostics':'Live balance sliders',text:summary,rows,actions:[...(page===0?[\n ['Restart this bout',()=>{const {mode,bout,court,seed}=w;app.prepare(mode,{bout,court,seed});app.world.cheated=true;}],\n ['Load chosen scenario',()=>{app.prepare(app.mode==='tour'?'tour':'quick',{bout:game.settings.devBout-1,court:COURTS.findIndex(c=>c.short===game.settings.devCourt),seed:w.seed});app.ais[1]=createAI(RIVALS[Number(game.settings.devRival.split('.')[0])-1]);app.world.cheated=true;}],\n ['More test tools',()=>app.tools()],['Court authoring',()=>app.editor()]]:[]),\n ['Next page',()=>app.developer((page+1)%pages)],['Reset balance defaults',()=>{for(const [k]of TUNING)game.settings.set('dev_'+k,DEFAULTS[k]);applyTuning(w,DEFAULTS);app.developer(page);}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});};\n app.tools=()=>shell.show('tools',{kicker:'LOCAL TOOLS · RESULTS ARE MARKED',title:'The useful mischief',text:()=>\"'`Tick ${app.world.tick} · ${app.stepOnly?'\"'manual stepping':'normal simulation'} · AI seats \"'${app.ais.map(a=>a?'\"'AI':'human').join(' / ')}\"'`,actions:[\n ['\"'Restore both castles',()=>{app.world.castles=createWorld({court:app.world.court,customCourt:app.customCourt,config:app.world.config}).castles;app.world.revision++;app.world.cheated=true;shell.toast('Castles restored');}],\n ['Clear airborne stones',()=>{app.world.shots=[];app.world.cheated=true;}],['Skip teaching',()=>{app.lessonDone=true;shell.tutorial(null);}],\n ['Toggle teal AI / human',()=>{app.ais[0]=app.ais[0]?null:createAI({...RIVALS[8],error:0});app.world.cheated=true;app.tools();}],\n ['Toggle coral AI / human',()=>{app.ais[1]=app.ais[1]?null:createAI(RIVALS[8]);app.world.cheated=true;app.tools();}],\n ['Pause / resume simulation',()=>{app.stepOnly=\"'!app.stepOnly;app.tools();}],\n ['\"'Step one fixed tick',()=>{step(app.world);drain();view.update(DT);app.tools();}],\n ['Force teal ceremony',()=>{app.world.cheated=true;finish(app.world,'developer inspection',0);drain();shell.hide();app.resultAt=game.real-2;}],\n ['Force coral ceremony',()=>{app.world.cheated=true;finish(app.world,'developer inspection',1);drain();shell.hide();app.resultAt=game.real-2;}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});\n app.editorBlock=()=>{const b=(app.customCourt||app.world.courtDef).blocks;app.editorIndex=clamp(app.editorIndex,0,b.length-1);return b[app.editorIndex];};\n app.editor=(page=0)=>{if(app.online)return;if(\"'!app.customCourt)app.customCourt=JSON.parse(exportCourt(app.world.courtDef)).court;const c=app.customCourt,b=app.editorBlock();view.selection=b;\n for(const [k,v]of [['\"'editorX',b.x],['editorZ',b.z],['editorMaterial',MATERIAL[b.material].name],['editorFoundation',b.foundation]])game.settings.set(k,v);\n const change=delta=>{app.applyEditor();app.editorIndex=(app.editorIndex+delta+c.blocks.length)%c.blocks.length;app.editor(page);};\n const support=c.blocks[(app.editorSupport||0)%c.blocks.length];\n shell.show('editor',{kicker:\"'`COURT WORKSHOP · BLOCK ${b.id} · ${page+1} / 2`,title:page?'\"'Supports & sharing':'Carve your own calamity',text:\"'`${c.name}. Select with the buttons, edit with arrows or pointer, then Apply. Symmetry is automatic. ${b.foundation?'\"'Foundation — not an objective.':'Objective — '+b.support.length+' support links.'}\"'`,rows:page?[]:['\"'editorX','editorZ','editorMaterial','editorFoundation'],actions:page?[\n [\"'`Support target: block ${support.id}`,()=>{app.editorSupport=((app.editorSupport||0)+1)%c.blocks.length;app.editor(1);}],\n [b.support.includes(support.id)?'\"'Unlink selected support':'Link selected support',()=>{if(b.id\"'!==support.id)b.support=b.support.includes(support.id)?b.support.filter(id=>id!==support.id):[...b.support,support.id];app.editor(1);}],\n ['\"'Validate geometry & reachability',()=>app.validateEditor()],['Preview support collapse',()=>{app.applyEditor();const found=app.world.castles[1].find(a=>a.id===b.id);if(found&&\"'!found.foundation){found.hp=0;app.world.revision++;importCollapse();}shell.hide();app.world.cheated=true;}],\n ['\"'Export definition',()=>{app.editorText=exportCourt(c);app.shareEditor();}],['Import definition',()=>app.shareEditor()],['Geometry page',()=>app.editor(0)],['Back',()=>{view.selection=null;shell.back();}]\n ]:[['Previous block',()=>change(-1)],['Next block',()=>change(1)],['Apply geometry',()=>{app.applyEditor();app.editor(0);}],['Add block',()=>{app.applyEditor();const id=Math.max(...c.blocks.map(a=>a.id))+1;c.blocks.push({id,x:clamp(b.x+20,22,180),z:b.z,w:19,h:18,material:'S',foundation:false,support:[b.id]});app.editorIndex=c.blocks.length-1;app.editor();}],['Remove block',()=>{if(c.blocks.length>2){c.blocks.splice(app.editorIndex,1);for(const a of c.blocks)a.support=a.support.filter(id=>id\"'!==b.id);app.editorIndex=0;app.editor();}}],['\"'Supports & sharing',()=>{app.applyEditor();app.editor(1);}],['Reset authored court',()=>{app.customCourt=null;view.selection=null;app.editorIndex=8;app.editor();}],['Back',()=>{view.selection=null;shell.back();}]]});};\n app.applyEditor=()=>{const b=app.editorBlock();b.x=game.settings.editorX;b.z=game.settings.editorZ;b.material=Object.keys(MATERIAL).find(k=>MATERIAL[k].name===game.settings.editorMaterial);b.foundation=game.settings.editorFoundation;\n const valid=validateCourt({version:1,court:app.customCourt});if(valid.ok){const fresh=createWorld({court:app.world.court,customCourt:app.customCourt,config:app.world.config});app.world.castles=fresh.castles;app.world.courtDef=app.customCourt;app.world.revision++;app.world.cheated=true;}return valid;};\n function importCollapse(){const b=app.world.castles[1],seen=connected(b);for(const a of b)if(\"'!a.foundation&&a.hp>0&&!seen.has(a.id)){a.hp=0;view.event({type:'\"'fall',seat:1,id:a.id,x:a.x,z:a.z,w:a.w,h:a.h,material:a.material,tick:app.world.tick});}}\n app.validateEditor=()=>{const valid=app.applyEditor();let msg=valid.errors.join(' ');if(valid.ok){const w=createWorld({customCourt:app.customCourt});let seen=new Set();for(let p=.1;p<1;p+=.003)for(const h of predict(w,0,0,p).hits)if(h.kind==='castle')seen.add(h.id);msg=\"'`Support graph connected. ${seen.size} visible blocks directly targetable; hidden blocks open as walls fall. Last-fragment reachability checked in verification.`;}shell.toast(valid.ok?'\"'Court is valid':'Court needs attention',msg,10);};\n app.shareEditor=()=>{shell.show('court-data',{kicker:'VERSION 1 COURT DATA',title:'Import / export',text:'The text stays local. Export copies into this field; paste a definition and choose Import. No files or network required.',actions:[['Import this definition',()=>{try{const raw=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('court-json').value),v=validateCourt(raw);if(\"'!v.ok)throw Error(v.errors.join('\"' '));app.customCourt=v.court;app.editorIndex=0;app.editorText='';app.applyEditor();shell.back();app.editor();}catch(e){shell.toast('Import rejected',String(e.message),8);}}],['Copy to clipboard',()=>{const el=document.getElementById('court-json');el.select();globalThis.navigator?.clipboard?.writeText(el.value)?.catch(()=>{});}],['Back',()=>shell.back()]]});\n if(typeof document\"'!=='\"'undefined'){const text=document.createElement('textarea');text.id='court-json';text.value=app.editorText||exportCourt(app.customCourt);text.setAttribute('aria-label','Court JSON definition');text.rows=7;const box=shell._els.scr.querySelector('.esh-mod');box.insertBefore(text,box.querySelector('.esh-btns'));text.addEventListener('keydown',e=>e.stopPropagation());}};\n function drain(){for(const e of app.world.events.splice(0)){view.event(e);audio.event(e);}}\n function hands(){if(app.ended||app.online?.info?.server)return;\n const count=app.mode==='local'?2:1;for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const seat=app.online?app.online.seat:i;if(seat===null)continue;const I=game.players[i]||game.input;\n if(I.padLost){app.cancelAll();if(app.online){shell.toast('Controller disconnected','The shared clock continues. Reconnect or use the keyboard.');}else game.pause('controller');continue;}\n if(app.ais[i]&&\"'!app.online)continue;\n const held=I.down('\"'fire');if(app.blocked[i]){if(\"'!held)app.blocked[i]=false;else continue;}\n if(I.pressed('\"'abort')){app.intent(seat,{kind:'cancel'});app.blocked[i]=true;app.wasFire[i]=false;continue;}\n if(held&&\"'!app.wasFire[i]){app.intent(seat,{kind:'\"'begin'});app.holdStart[i]=game.real;}\n if(\"'!held&&app.wasFire[i])app.intent(seat,{kind:'\"'release'});\n app.wasFire[i]=held;\n if(I.pressed('previous'))app.choose(seat,-1);if(I.pressed('next'))app.choose(seat,1);\n if(I.down('left')||I.down('right'))view.guidance[seat]=clamp(view.guidance[seat]+(I.down('right')?1:-1)*2,25,935);\n }\n }\n function teaching(){if(app.lessonDone||app.mode\"'!=='\"'tour')return;const w=app.world,shot=w.coverage.launch.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),hit=w.players[0].score;\n if(app.lesson===0&&shot>app.lessonShot)app.lesson=1;if(app.lesson===1&&hit>0)app.lesson=2;\n const p=game.input.label('fire'),prev=game.input.label('previous'),next=game.input.label('next');\n let title,text;if(app.lesson===0){title='Wind up, your lordship.';text=\"'`Hold ${p}. The diamond shows the first contact. Release to fling.`;}else if(app.lesson===1){title='\"'A little more. A little less.';text='Aim for the far castle. Full tension overshoots; try about two-thirds.';}else{title=w.bout>=4?'Split the difference.':w.bout>=2?'Mind the supports.':'A most respectable hit\"'!'\"';text=w.bout>=4?\"'`${prev} / ${next}: split stone fans into three at the apex. Roundstone finishes small pieces.`:w.bout>=2?`${prev} / ${next}: masonry stone breaks reinforced blocks and their supports.`:'\"'Castle hits are permanent. Crew and launcher hits buy a brief opening.';if(shot>app.lessonShot+3){app.lessonDone=true;}}\n app.lessonText={title,text};\n }\n function combatUpdate(dt){if(app.online){app.online.update();if(app.ended)return;if(\"'!app.online.info?.server){if(!shell.screen&&!game.paused)hands();view.update(dt,{seat:app.online.seat??0,assist:game.settings.prediction,reduced:game.reduceMotion});updateHUD();}return;}\n if(!shell.screen&&!game.paused)hands();\n if(!app.stepOnly){app.simCarry=(app.simCarry||0)+app.simSpeed;while(app.simCarry>=1){for(let s=0;s<2;s++)if(app.ais[s]){\n  // The opening opponent waits for a real first shot, giving the first lesson room to breathe.\n  if(app.mode==='\"'tour'&&app.world.bout===0&&app.lesson===0&&\"'!app.lessonDone)continue;\n  aiStep(app.world,s,app.ais[s]);}\n step(app.world);app.simCarry--;}}\n drain();teaching();view.update(dt,{seat:0,assist:game.settings.prediction,reduced:game.reduceMotion});updateHUD();\n if(app.world.outcome&&!app.resultCount){if(!app.resultAt)app.resultAt=game.real;if(game.real-app.resultAt>=1.8)app.result();}\n }\n const scenes={title:{view:'\"'siege',camera:{zoom:false},update(dt){view.update(dt,{title:true,reduced:game.reduceMotion});if(app.mode==='attract'){app.attractTicks++;\n const elapsed=(app.attractTicks-app.attractSegmentTick)*DT;for(let s=0;s<2;s++){app.ais[s].goal=elapsed<7?'launcher':elapsed<13?'crew':null;aiStep(app.world,s,app.ais[s]);}\n step(app.world);drain();if(app.world.outcome&&elapsed>27||elapsed>=30)app.attractNext();updateHUD();}else{app.idleTicks++;if(app.idleTicks>=1200)app.beginAttract();}},draw:r=>view.draw(r)},combat:{view:'siege',camera:{zoom:false},pausable:true,update:combatUpdate,draw:r=>{if(\"'!app.online?.info?.server)view.draw(r);},back(){app.cancelAll();return false;}}};\n game.hook('\"'input',()=>{const I=game.input;if(app.ended){I.consumeAll();for(const p of game.players)p.clear();return;}\n if(I.anyPressed()){app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){app.exitAttract();I.consumeAll();I.clear();return;}}\n if(I.pressed('pause')||game.paused&&\"'!app.lastPaused){app.cancelAll();}app.lastPaused=game.paused;\n if(app.online&&game.paused&&app.online.intentStart!==null)app.online.intent('\"'cancel');\n });\n // Native shell keeps device focus; pointer hover follows the same focus ring.\n if(typeof document\"'!=='\"'undefined'){\n document.addEventListener('pointerover',e=>{if(e.target.matches('.esh button:not(:disabled)'))e.target.focus({preventScroll:true});});\n document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(app.ended){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();return;}app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();app.exitAttract();}},true);\n document.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(app.ended){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();return;}app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();app.exitAttract();}},true);\n document.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(Math.abs(e.movementX)+Math.abs(e.movementY)>1)app.idleTicks=0;});\n document.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{app.idleTicks=0;if(app.mode==='attract'){e.preventDefault();app.exitAttract();}},{capture:true,passive:false});\n addEventListener('blur',()=>app.cancelAll());document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden)app.cancelAll();});\n const canvas=document.getElementById('screen');\n game.input.touchEnabled=false;game.input.touchFilter=()=>false;\n canvas.addEventListener('contextmenu',e=>e.preventDefault());\n canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.pointerType==='mouse'||app.mode==='title'||app.mode==='attract'||shell.screen||app.ended)return;\n if(app.pointers.size)return;e.preventDefault();canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);const seat=app.online?app.online.seat:app.mode==='local'&&e.clientX>innerWidth/2?1:0;if(seat===null)return;\n app.pointers.set(e.pointerId,seat);game.input.lastDevice='touch';app.intent(seat,{kind:'begin'});app.touchPoint={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY};});\n canvas.addEventListener('pointerup',e=>{if(\"'!app.pointers.has(e.pointerId))return;e.preventDefault();const seat=app.pointers.get(e.pointerId);app.pointers.delete(e.pointerId);app.intent(seat,{kind:'\"'release'});app.touchPoint=null;});\n canvas.addEventListener('pointercancel',e=>{if(app.pointers.has(e.pointerId)){app.intent(app.pointers.get(e.pointerId),{kind:'cancel'});app.pointers.delete(e.pointerId);app.touchPoint=null;}});\n canvas.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{if(app.mode\"'!=='\"'title'&&\"'!shell.screen){e.preventDefault();app.choose(app.online?.seat??0,e.deltaY>0?1:-1);}},{passive:false});\n canvas.addEventListener('\"'pointermove',e=>{if(e.pointerType==='mouse'&&app.world){const p=game.input.screenPoint(e.clientX,e.clientY);if(p){const worldx=p[0]+game.screen.ix;view.guidance[app.online?.seat??0]=worldx;app.hover=app.world.castles.flat().find(b=>b.hp>0&&worldx>=b.x&&worldx<=b.x+b.w&&-(p[1]+game.screen.iy)>=b.z&&-(p[1]+game.screen.iy)<=b.z+b.h)||null;}}});\n createHUD();\n }\n function createHUD(){const root=document.createElement('div');root.id='combat-hud';root.innerHTML='<div class=\\\"court-clock\\\"><span id=\\\"court-name\\\"></span><strong id=\\\"clock\\\"></strong><small id=\\\"bout-label\\\"></small></div>'+[0,1].map(s=>\"'`<section class=\"team-plate team-${s}\"><div class=\"plate-name\"><span id=\"seat-${s}\"></span><b id=\"score-${s}\"></b></div><div class=\"health-rail\"><i id=\"health-${s}\"></i></div><div class=\"power-rail\"><i id=\"power-${s}\"></i></div><div class=\"plate-foot\"><span id=\"stone-${s}\"></span><strong id=\"status-${s}\"></strong></div></section>`).join('\"'')+'<div id=\\\"lesson-card\\\"><b></b><span></span><button id=\\\"skip-lesson\\\">Skip lesson</button></div><div id=\\\"combat-caption\\\"></div><div id=\\\"stone-tray\\\"></div><div id=\\\"combat-hint\\\"></div><div id=\\\"attract-label\\\"><b>THE ROYAL EXHIBITION</b><span>Demonstration · any input returns to the menu</span></div><div id=\\\"touch-halo\\\"></div><canvas id=\\\"target-inset\\\" width=\\\"250\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" aria-label=\\\"Magnified opposing castle\\\"></canvas>';\n document.body.appendChild(root);document.getElementById('skip-lesson').onclick=()=>{app.lessonDone=true;};for(let i=0;i<3;i++){const b=document.createElement('button');b.dataset.stone=i;b.innerHTML=\"'`<span class=\"stone-icon icon-${i}\"></span><span>${STONES[i].short}</span>`;b.onclick=()=>{if(!shell.screen)app.intent(app.online?.seat??0,{kind:'\"'stone',stone:i});};document.getElementById('stone-tray').appendChild(b);}app.hud=root;}\n function setText(id,text){const el=document.getElementById(id);if(el&&el.textContent\"'!==text)el.textContent=text;}\n function updateHUD(){if(!app.hud)return;const w=app.world,show=['\"'tour','quick','local','hub','attract'].includes(app.mode)&&\"'!shell.screen&&!app.ended;app.hud.hidden=!show;document.body.dataset.mode=app.mode;\n if(!show)return;const online=app.online,info=online?.info;\n setText('\"'court-name',w.courtDef.short);setText('clock',online&&\"'!online.started?'\"'READY':online&&online.hub.time()<0?Math.ceil(-online.hub.time()/1000).toString():\"'`${Math.floor(Math.max(0,w.deadline-w.tick)*DT/60)}:${String(Math.ceil(Math.max(0,w.deadline-w.tick)*DT)%60).padStart(2,'\"'0')}\"'`);\n setText('\"'bout-label',app.tour?\"'`BOUT ${w.bout+1} OF 10 · ×${w.bout+1} POINTS`:online?'\"'HUB DUEL':'EXHIBITION DUEL');\n for(let s=0;s<2;s++){const p=w.players[s],pow=online&&s===online.seat&&online.intentStart\"'!==null?clamp((online.hub.time()/1000-online.intentStart)/w.config.chargeTime,0,1):powerOf(w,p),end=Math.max(p.crewUntil,p.launcherUntil);\n setText(`seat-${s}`,info?.players[s]?.name||(s===1&&app.ais[1]?(app.mode==='\"'tour'?RIVALS[w.bout].name:app.ais[1].profile.name):TEAM[s].name));setText(\"'`score-${s}`,`${p.score} PTS`);document.getElementById(`health-${s}`).style.width=health(w,s)*100+'\"'%';document.getElementById(\"'`power-${s}`).style.width=pow*100+'\"'%';\n setText(\"'`stone-${s}`,STONES[p.stone].short);setText(`status-${s}`,w.outcome?'\"'BELL\"'!'\"':w.tick<p.launcherUntil?\"'`⚒ REPAIR ${((p.launcherUntil-w.tick)*DT).toFixed(1)}`:w.tick<p.crewUntil?`CREW AWAY ${((p.crewUntil-w.tick)*DT).toFixed(1)}`:w.tick<p.protectUntil&&w.tick>=end?'\"'◇ PROTECTED':p.charge>=0?\"'`${Math.round(pow*100)}% TENSION`:w.tick<p.ready?'\"'RELOADING':'READY');}\n const seat=online?.seat??0;for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-stone]')){b.classList.toggle('selected',Number(b.dataset.stone)===w.players[seat].stone);b.disabled=\"'!w.allowed.includes(Number(b.dataset.stone));}\n document.getElementById('\"'attract-label').hidden=app.mode\"'!=='\"'attract';document.getElementById('stone-tray').hidden=app.mode==='attract';\n const lesson=document.getElementById('lesson-card');lesson.hidden=app.lessonDone||app.mode\"'!=='\"'tour';if(\"'!lesson.hidden&&app.lessonText){lesson.querySelector('\"'b').textContent=app.lessonText.title;lesson.querySelector('span').textContent=app.lessonText.text;}\n const device=game.input.lastDevice,touch=device==='touch';app.hud.classList.toggle('touch',touch);setText('combat-hint',touch?'Hold to wind · release to sling':\"'`${app.fireLabel()}  HOLD / RELEASE     ${game.input.label('\"'previous')} / \"'${game.input.label('\"'next')}  STONE     \"'${game.input.label('\"'abort')}  CANCEL\"'`);\n setText('\"'combat-caption',game.real<app.captionUntil?app.caption:app.hover?\"'`${MATERIAL[app.hover.material].name} · ${Math.ceil(app.hover.hp)} health`:'\"'');\n const halo=document.getElementById('touch-halo');halo.hidden=\"'!app.touchPoint;if(app.touchPoint){halo.style.left=app.touchPoint.x+'\"'px';halo.style.top=app.touchPoint.y+'px';halo.textContent=Math.round(powerOf(w,w.players[seat])*100)+'%';}\n const cv=document.getElementById('target-inset');cv.hidden=innerHeight<innerWidth||shell.screen\"'!==null; // native pixel target enlarged, while the complete lane stays visible below.\n if(!cv.hidden&&game.screen.buf){const ctx=cv.getContext('\"'2d');ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;const a=game.r.w(seat?30:750,0,178),b=game.r.w(seat?215:935,0,25);ctx.clearRect(0,0,250,160);try{ctx.drawImage(game.screen.buf,a[0],a[1],b[0]-a[0],b[1]-a[1],0,0,250,160);}catch{}}\n }\n app.snapshot=()=>({mode:app.mode,phase:app.world?.phase,tick:app.world?.tick,court:app.world?.court,bout:app.world?.bout,health:app.world?[health(app.world,0),health(app.world,1)]:null,shots:app.world?.shots.length,coverage:app.world?.coverage,outcome:app.world?.outcome,tour:app.tour,menu:shell.screen,lesson:app.lesson,errors:game.errors});\n game.debug={snapshot:app.snapshot};game.fadeTime=0;\n app.startOnline=async()=>{app.online=new OnlineMatch(globalThis.AIHub,{onWorld:w=>{app.world=w;app.mode='hub';app.ais=[null,null];view.reset(w);shell.hide();game.go('combat',null,{fade:0});},onEnd:e=>{app.ended=true;app.cancelAll();audio.stop();game.input.clear();app.hud&&(app.hud.hidden=true);shell.hide();app.caption=e.reason;},onEvent:e=>{view.event(e);if(\"'!app.online.info?.server)audio.event(e);}});\n const info=await app.online.connect();if(!info){app.online=null;game.live=false;app.title();}else{game.o.menu.quit=false;game.live=true;if(!info.server)audio.music(4);}};\n game.start({scene:'\"'title',scenes});\n if(globalThis.AIHub?.active)app.startOnline().catch(e=>game.fail('Hub connection',e));else app.title();\n if(typeof window\"'!=='\"'undefined'){window.__SIEGE={app,game,get world(){return app.world;},command,predict,planShot,createAI,aiStep,step,REPORT};window.__game={game};document.title=TITLE;}\n return app;\n}\nfunction safeStorage(){try{return globalThis.localStorage||{getItem(){return null;},setItem(){},removeItem(){}};}catch{return {getItem(){return null;},setItem(){},removeItem(){}};}}\nEOF\ncat > src/entry.js <<'EOF'\nimport { boot } from './app.js';\nboot(globalThis.My3D2dge);\nEOF\ncat > src/style.css <<'EOF'\n:root{--ui-scale:1; color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#182d3b;color:#f2e7d0}body{font-family:'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif}#screen{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;touch-action:none}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f5d390;outline-offset:3px}button:disabled{opacity:.4}.esh{--accent:#efd194\"'!important;--paper:#172b39!important;--line:#677e80!important}.esh-sh{background:#101f2cdb!important;padding:30px!important}.esh-sh h2{font:normal 31px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#ffe7b0}.esh-mod{border:1px solid #84908b!important;border-radius:2px!important;box-shadow:0 8px 0 #0a1823,0 22px 70px #050d15aa!important;max-width:650px!important;max-height:94%!important;padding:26px 30px!important;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#273e49,#172b39)!important}.esh-pan{border-radius:2px!important}.esh-k{color:#dbbe85!important;letter-spacing:.19em!important;font-size:10px!important}.esh-m{color:#c3ccc4!important;line-height:1.55!important}.esh-sh button{border:1px solid #6b8285!important;border-radius:2px!important;background:#1b3341!important;min-height:40px!important;padding:10px 16px!important;text-align:left!important;letter-spacing:.025em;transition:background .14s,border-color .14s}.esh-sh button:hover,.esh-sh button:focus{background:#344b52!important;border-color:#efcf8e!important;outline:none!important;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #efcf8e!important}.esh-sh button.pri{color:#182b38!important;background:#edce91!important;border-color:#f8e3b9!important;font-weight:bold!important}.esh-sh button.pri:focus,.esh-sh button.pri:hover{background:#ffe6b3!important;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #6f6147!important}.esh-ttl{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#152b39fb,#142c3aeb 33%,#142c3a38 68%,#152d3a00)!important;padding:0!important;place-items:center start!important}.esh-ttl>div{margin-left:5.8vw;padding:0!important;max-width:520px!important;position:relative}.esh-ttl>div:before{content:'\"'♜';display:block;color:#d7bd82;font:36px Georgia;line-height:1;margin-bottom:18px}.esh-ttl h1{white-space:pre-line\"'!important;font:700 clamp(40px,4.4vw,67px)/.93 Georgia,serif!important;letter-spacing:-.055em!important;color:#f6e4bd!important;text-shadow:0 3px 0 #5c5d54,0 9px 20px #102431;margin:12px 0 0!important}.esh-sub{font:italic 21px Georgia!important;color:#e9c27e!important;margin:16px 0 18px!important}.esh-ttl p{font-size:14px!important;color:#bdcfcb!important}.esh-ttl .esh-btns{max-width:245px;gap:6px!important}.esh-ttl .esh-btns button{font-size:14px!important;min-height:37px!important;padding:8px 14px!important}.esh-ttl .esh-tags{font-size:9px!important;gap:14px!important;color:#bdd2cf!important}.esh-ttl .esh-m{font-size:9px!important;max-width:290px;margin-top:10px!important}.esh-sec{margin-top:16px!important}.esh-row{border-color:#516974!important}input[type=range]{accent-color:#e8c688}#court-json{width:100%;min-height:130px;border:1px solid #7c9294;background:#0f2230;color:#e9dfc1;font:10px/1.4 monospace;resize:vertical;padding:10px}.esh-btns{gap:6px!important}.esh-stats{color:#edce91!important}.esh-emb{font-size:35px!important;color:#efce8c!important}.esh-back{color:#f2dbac!important}\n#combat-hud{pointer-events:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:12;color:#f4e6c5;font-size:clamp(12px,1.4vw,27px);padding:3.2vh 3.2vw;letter-spacing:.025em}#combat-hud[hidden],[hidden]{display:none!important}.team-plate{position:absolute;top:4vh;width:28vw;max-width:550px;padding:14px 18px 12px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#17313feb,#233b44db);border-top:3px solid #7adcd1;box-shadow:0 7px 0 #1527337a}.team-0{left:3.2vw}.team-1{right:3.2vw;border-color:#eea17d;background:linear-gradient(250deg,#28323feb,#403b45db)}.plate-name{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-weight:bold;font-size:.84em}.plate-name span{color:#a1e4db;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.team-1 .plate-name span{color:#f3b99a}.plate-name b{font-size:.8em;white-space:nowrap;color:#edce91}.health-rail{height:5px;background:#122533;margin:11px 0 7px;position:relative}.health-rail i{display:block;height:100%;background:#7ac8b5;transition:width .15s}.team-1 .health-rail i{background:#da947d}.power-rail{height:9px;background:#102632;border:1px solid #647a7b}.power-rail i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8dccb4,#f2d18b,#ed9878)}.plate-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:7px;font-size:.56em;letter-spacing:.08em}.plate-foot strong{color:#ecd397;font-weight:normal}.court-clock{position:absolute;left:50%;top:4vh;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-shadow:0 2px 3px #203441;gap:4px;white-space:nowrap}.court-clock span{font-size:.51em;letter-spacing:.25em;color:#f9e6c0}.court-clock strong{font:normal clamp(28px,3.3vw,63px)/1 Georgia,serif;color:#fff0c9}.court-clock small{font-size:.38em;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#d1dcd5}#stone-tray{position:absolute;bottom:6.8vh;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:8px;pointer-events:auto}#stone-tray button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:1px solid #8b9b94;background:#213944e8;color:#bdcdc7;font:inherit;font-size:.6em;letter-spacing:.13em;padding:12px 19px;min-height:48px;box-shadow:0 4px #132733;white-space:nowrap}#stone-tray button.selected{border-color:#f5d596;color:#f5d596;background:#3e4d4de8;box-shadow:inset 0 -3px #e1c083,0 4px #142631}.stone-icon{width:15px;height:15px;background:#d3e4e8;border:2px solid #7f9399;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:inset 3px 3px #f6ead1}.icon-1{width:19px;height:19px;border-radius:2px;background:#ddb176;transform:rotate(-15deg)}.icon-2{background:#b8a0e2;border-color:#7b659f;clip-path:polygon(50% 0,100% 25%,90% 83%,50% 100%,0 68%,10% 15%)}#combat-hint{position:absolute;bottom:2.8vh;left:0;width:100%;text-align:center;font-size:.49em;letter-spacing:.09em;text-shadow:1px 2px 3px #112739;color:#d5ded5}#combat-caption{position:absolute;left:50%;top:27vh;transform:translateX(-50%);font:italic .75em Georgia,serif;text-align:center;max-width:50vw;color:#fce4b4;text-shadow:0 2px 4px #263c48}#lesson-card{position:absolute;left:3.2vw;bottom:18vh;max-width:28vw;background:#203744f0;border-left:3px solid #edcb8b;padding:14px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;box-shadow:0 6px #13263366}#lesson-card b{font:normal 1em Georgia;color:#f4d59b}#lesson-card span{font-size:.64em;line-height:1.4;color:#d8dfd5}#lesson-card button{pointer-events:auto;align-self:flex-start;border:0;background:none;color:#c9b98e;font-size:.52em;padding:2px 0;text-decoration:underline}#attract-label{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:5vh;transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center;background:#1b3343e8;border:1px solid #c5b27d;padding:17px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:430px}#attract-label b{font:1.1em Georgia;color:#f4daa5;letter-spacing:.07em}#attract-label span{font-size:.6em;color:#cbd6cc}#touch-halo{position:fixed;border:2px solid #f5d697;border-radius:50%;width:82px;height:82px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;background:#23394560;font:bold 22px Georgia;color:#fff0be;box-sha