{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"agent_message","text":"The first browser pass found no runtime errors, and the native rendering works. Visual review caught two presentation issues: combat HUD elements appeared on the title screen, and the title menu extended below the TV frame. I’ve fixed both. The simulation checks are now exercising reachability, recovery, and the complete tour.\n"}}
